<title>PORTUGAL: Cimpor privatisation shares quoted April 16.</title>
<headline>Cimpor privatisation shares quoted April 16.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 13.5 million shares sold to employees, small investors and emigrants in the second phase of the privatisation of Portuguese cement concern Cimpor can be traded from April 16, a Lisbon bourse spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal closed 14 escudos higher at 3,399 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon bureau 351-13150035</p>
</text>
